{"parse": {"title": "Dark Chest", "pageid": 299948, "revid": 15201650, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{Otheruses|def=no|the chest located inside the [[Isle of Souls Dungeon]]|Chest (Isle of Souls Dungeon)}}\n{{Infobox Scenery\n|version1 = Closed\n|version2 = Open\n|name = Dark Chest\n|image1 = [[File:Dark Chest (closed).png|300px]]\n|image2 = [[File:Dark Chest (open).png|300px]]\n|release = [[3 February]] [[2021]]\n|update = The Isle of Souls\n|members = Yes\n|quest = No\n|location = [[Crumbling Tower]] basement\n|options1 = Open, Check\n|options2 = None\n|examine1 = I wonder what's inside it.\n|examine2 = An open chest.\n|map = {{Map|name=Crumbling Tower|x=2131|y=2994|mtype=square|r=2.5}}\n|id1 = 40742\n|id2 = 40743\n}}\nThe '''Dark Chest''' is a chest in the basement of the [[Crumbling Tower]] on the [[Isle of Souls]]. It can be opened with a [[dark key]] for 1,500 [[Thieving]] experience, which uses up the key.\n\nAfter opening the chest it will slam shut on the player's hands, dealing up to 10 damage.\n\n==Location==\n{{ObjectTableHead}}\n{{ObjectLocLine\n|name = Dark Chest\n|location = [[Crumbling Tower]] basement\n|members = Yes\n|mapID = -1\n|zoom=5\n|x:1928,y:9448\n|x:1929,y:9449\n|x:1929,y:9446\n|x:1930,y:9446\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = Misthalin\n}}\n{{ObjectTableBottom}}\n\n==Thieving info==\n{{Thieving info\n|name = Dark Chest\n|level =28 \n|xp = 1500\n|type = Chest\n|tool = [[Dark key]]\n}}\nThieving from this chest requires a [[dark key]] and level 28 [[Thieving]], the same level requirement as the [[Chest (Isle of Souls Dungeon)|Isle of Souls Dungeon chest]]. Below level 28, a chatbox message will state {{mes|You need a Thieving level of 28 to be able to open this chest.}}\n\n==Loot==\n{{DropLogProject|kills=19705|type=loots}}\n\n{{Average drop value|mob=Dark Chest|killname=opening}}\n\n===Pre-roll===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Shield left half|quantity=1|rarity=1/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Dragon plateskirt|quantity=1|rarity=1/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Dragon platelegs|quantity=1|rarity=1/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Equipment===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Rune pickaxe|quantity=1|rarity=15/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Rune axe|quantity=1|rarity=15/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Rune longsword|quantity=1|rarity=5/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Rune kiteshield|quantity=1|rarity=10/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Rune chainbody|quantity=1|rarity=10/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Runes and ammunition===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Mind rune|quantity=400-600|rarity=25/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Chaos rune|quantity=300-500|rarity=25/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Blood rune|quantity=100-200|rarity=25/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Nature rune|quantity=150-350|rarity=25/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Law rune|quantity=100-300|rarity=27/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Death rune|quantity=200-400|rarity=27/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Adamant arrow|quantity=200-400|rarity=40/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Rune arrow|quantity=100-300|rarity=30/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Herbs===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Grimy dwarf weed|quantity=10-15 (noted)|rarity=25/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Grimy torstol|quantity=10-15 (noted)|rarity=25/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Grimy ranarr weed|quantity=10-15 (noted)|rarity=25/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Grimy snapdragon|quantity=10-15 (noted)|rarity=25/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Leather===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Green dragon leather|quantity=5-10 (noted)|rarity=20/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Blue dragon leather|quantity=5-10 (noted)|rarity=20/600|skill=thieving}}\n{{DropsLineS